r  from there a witness also said the  officer lives in the same complex police  say the officer was wearing a body  camera but that video will not be  released yet  the district  News Office is investigating the  shooting along with the bay town police  and that officer is now on three days  leave according to policy terrible  morticians they're you know very  disturbing thank you very much thank you
 

